{
 "_readme": "Serial numbering of the 38 Sarvamula granthas of Sri Madhvacharya, settled by scholarly review 14 Sep 2026. SM13 is Anuvyakhyana; SM13.3 its third tika; SM13.3.1 a commentary on that tika; SM13.3:412 a unit inside it. Works by later acharyas take an L prefix, not SM -- they are not Madhva's. Replaces the imported site's own record numbers; the mapping back lives in Parabuddhi.",
