  "sub_tika": "SM<serial>.<t>.<s>",
  "unit": "<code>:<n>",
  "later_acharya": "L<serial>"
 },
 "code_note": "The id is SM<serial> alone -- deliberately short. The reviewer's markup sketched a longer form carrying the prasthana (SM1-D.P-1-P.L), but 'S.P' was used there for BOTH Sutra Prasthana and Stotra Prasthana, which two different works cannot share in an identifier. The prasthana is kept as a separate `group` field instead, so it can be displayed without being load-bearing.",
